WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.305
Adding two bits produces a sum bit and a carry bit.

00:00:03.305 --> 00:00:06.310
Sum = A XOR B; carry = A AND B.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.615
Adding two bits produces a sum bit and a carry bit.

00:00:10.615 --> 00:00:13.620
